<title>NEW ZEALAND: S&amp;P puts TransAlta NZ on creditwatch.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P puts TransAlta NZ on creditwatch.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Debt rating agency Standard &amp; Poor's said on Thursday it had placed TransAlta New Zealand Ltd, majority owned by Canada's TransAlta Energy Corp, on creditwatch with negative implications following its announcement earlier this week that it would buy two North Island power stations.</p>
</text>
